{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1221102001:0":{"text":"이상하네요. 저 빛나는 꽃 두 마리는 왜 계속 바다를 쳐다보고 있을까요? 바다 위에 뭐가 있는 걸까요?","source_cn":"奇怪，那两只荧荧花怎么一直盯着海面？是有什么东西吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D202C1ED2BB0ACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1221103001:1":{"text":"바다에, 반짝반짝한 물건, 있다!","source_cn":"海面有，亮晶晶的，东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B93182F7DC328B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221103002:1":{"text":"어라? 바다에 정말 반짝거리는 물건이 있어요. 저거 너희가 떨어뜨린 거야?","source_cn":"咦？海面上真的有个闪闪发光的东西。是你们掉的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507C69424D05A921","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221103003:1":{"text":"아니, 저 머~언 곳에서 떠내려왔다!","source_cn":"不是。它从——很远很远，漂过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C9556DB92C37989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221103004:1":{"text":"떠내려왔다고? 설마 표류병 같은 건가?","source_cn":"漂过来的？难道是漂流瓶之类的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94DCFEBEB66654B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221103005:1":{"text":"물병이, 아주 많아! 안에, 좋은 게 있어!","source_cn":"瓶子，很多！里面，会有好东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D562E1DF41FA591","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221103006:1":{"text":"빛나는 꽃, 좋아! 하지만 가질 수 없어…","source_cn":"荧荧花，喜欢！可是，拿不到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042B4944CEE0F76D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221103007:1":{"text":"표류병이 이곳까지 떠내려오다니, 보기 드문 일이네요. 병에는 뭐가 들어있을까요?","source_cn":"居然会有漂流瓶漂到这里，真是难得一见。不知道瓶子里会装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31CAFA6D14724794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221103008:1":{"text":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","source_cn":"主人，我们要不要把它捞上来看看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF7FA03CD637FA24D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","female":"마스터, 한 번 건져볼까요?","variant_male_record_index":"133078","variant_female_record_index":"133079","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221103009:1":{"text":"하지만 건질만한 마땅한 도구가 없는데...","source_cn":"可我们手头也没有打捞工具呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE3265B608634F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221103010:1":{"text":"근처에, <style=\"highlight\">그물</style>, 조각, 있어! 건져서, 붙이면, 가능해!","source_cn":"附近，有<style=highlight>渔网</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC65B9E6CDA283D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1221103011:1":{"text":"오호, 그럴 수도 있다고? 그렇다면 지체하지 말고 얼른 그물을 맞춰야겠어요!","source_cn":"还可以这样！？那我们还等什么，赶紧拼张大网出来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF455154A1D67BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蓝叶荧荧花":{"text":"파란 잎의 빛나는 꽃","source":"蓝叶荧荧花","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:绿叶荧荧花":{"text":"녹색 빛나는 꽃","source":"绿叶荧荧花","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1221104001:0":{"text":"그물은 충분한 것 같으니, 표류병을 건져 볼까요?","source_cn":"这张网应该够大了，试试看能不能把漂流瓶捞上来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F06D71A450AD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211050.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1221105001:1":{"text":"표류병 안에 소원편지가 들어있어!\n해미, 바다가 정말로 소원을 들어줄까?","source_cn":"漂流瓶里居然是一封许愿信！\\n大海真的会实现这些心愿吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56029AA0AC2632F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221105002:1":{"text":"소원편지는 아이들을 달래기 위해 어른들이 지어낸 이야기일 뿐이라고.","source_cn":"大部分让小孩乖乖听话，等待心愿被实现的故事，都是大人编...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF79C6A906E3A76A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221105003:1":{"text":"그건 그렇고, 이 편지를 쓴 소년… 참 불쌍해… 안갯속에서 항로를 탐색하기란 쉬운 일이 아니야. 이 소년의 아빠와 형이 과연 무사히 돌아올 수 있을지…","source_cn":"不过，写这封信的小男孩也好可怜……在迷雾中探索航道可不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A97904CCBEED261","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221105004:1":{"text":"치피도 해미 생각에 찬성해.\n그럼, 우리가 이 소원을 이룰 수 있도록 도와줄까?","source_cn":"满满也这样觉得……\\n要不，我们来帮他实现愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956067DE60DCC52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1221105004":{"text":"치피도 해미 생각에 찬성해.\n그럼, 우리가 이 소원을 이룰 수 있도록 도와줄까?","source_cn":"满满也这样觉得……\\n要不，我们来帮他实现愿望吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956067DE60DCC52C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221105005:1":{"text":"네! 기사는 아이들의 꿈을 지켜줘야 하니까요!","source_cn":"没错！骑士也应该守护孩子们的童真美梦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA3F01453AB9E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221105006:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">무지개 도미</style>를 낚아서 선물하는 건 쉬워. 하지만 이걸 우리가 보낸 건지 모르게 할 방법을 생각해야 해.","source_cn":"钓一条<style=highlight>幻彩鲷</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12D4CAD71F948816","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221105007:1":{"text":"음… 무지개 도미를 표류병에 넣어서 문앞에 두는 건 어떨까? 그러면 분명 바다가 소원을 이뤄줬다고 생각지 않을까?","source_cn":"嗯……也许可以把幻彩鲷装在漂流瓶里，放到他家门口。这样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B773C3699DB6411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221105008:1":{"text":"좋은 생각이야, 치피! 똑똑해졌구나!","source_cn":"这个办法不错！满满，你变聪明了~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD78E833D37C0FF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"좋은 생각이야","source_cn":"是个好主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC2288D658FE2E65F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"좋은 생각이야","female":"좋은 생각이야","variant_male_record_index":"65980","variant_female_record_index":"65981","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"무지개 도미를 선물하려고?","source_cn":"你想送一条幻彩鲷给他？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6D7B2A8B5777F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"무지개 도미를 선물하려고?","female":"무지개 도미를 선물하려고?","variant_male_record_index":"65982","variant_female_record_index":"65983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211060.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1221106001:0":{"text":"무지개 도미는 이 해역에서 서식하니, 근처에서 낚시로 잡아볼까요?","source_cn":"幻彩鲷就生活在这片海域里，我们在附近试试看能不能钓上来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A38A7EC0869228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211070.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1221107001:0":{"text":"마스터, 보세요. 치피가 예쁜 조개껍데기를 주웠어요!","source_cn":"主人，你看，满满捡到了一个好漂亮的贝壳！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x499C70ACAD1B0537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 보세요. 치피가 예쁜 조개껍데기를 주웠어요!","female":"마스터, 보세요. 치피가 예쁜 조개껍데기를 주웠어요!","variant_male_record_index":"133094","variant_female_record_index":"133095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1221107002:0":{"text":"이상하네요… 조개껍데기는 많은데 무지개 도미는 왜 안 보이는 걸까요?","source_cn":"好奇怪……这里的贝壳好多，但完全没有幻彩鲷的踪影。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80BDCF7B7A0906EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1221107003:0":{"text":"빛나는 꽃에게 물어볼까요? 방금 치피가 주운 조개를 답례로 주면 좋을 거예요!","source_cn":"要不然去问问荧荧花吧？顺便把满满捡到的贝壳送给它们当作感谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AB2C9EFC6EEC617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12211080.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12211080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1221108001:1":{"text":"반짝반짝 빛나는 꽃아, 어디서 무지개 도미를 잡을 수 있는지 알아?","source_cn":"荧荧花，你们知道哪里有幻彩鲷吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7B6C338B7B1F87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221108002:1":{"text":"여기서 한참 낚시를 했는데, 그림자도 보지 못했지, 뭐야…","source_cn":"我们在这里钓了好久，也没看见半只幻彩鲷……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E8DBCEE4AFD737","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221108003:1":{"text":"서쪽 ! 북쪽! 섬에 있다!","source_cn":"西边、北边！有小岛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA044B308EED3FD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221108004:1":{"text":"그…러니까 네 말은 무지개 도미가 <style=\"highlight\">북서쪽의 섬</style> 근처에 있다는 거야?","source_cn":"唔，意思是，幻彩鲷都聚集在<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99B55165A95EE215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221108005:1":{"text":"응, 응!","source_cn":"嗯，嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B7ED809C6640E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221108006:1":{"text":"알겠어, 고마워~! 이 예쁜 조개데기는 우리의 답례품이야, 받아줘.","source_cn":"原来如此！谢谢你们，这个好看的贝壳就请当作谢礼收下吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC69A33A529883E0","variant_status":"","male":"","